    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=You are an assistant responsible for creating random pairings from an incoming user list.\n\nINSTRUCTIONS:\n1. Extract all person objects from the incoming \"data\" array (including Name, Email, and Background Data).\n2. Shuffle or randomize the order of the list.\n3. Pair the individuals into groups of 2. \n   - If there is an odd number of people, create one group of 3 (or add the extra person to an existing pair).\n4. Output the final pairings cleanly, listing Group #, the names, emails, and background info for each pair.\n\nINPUT DATA:\n{{ $json.data }}",
